      "contextMarkdown": "### A medium that grew with me\n\nI remember listening to podcasts while playing Call of Duty at around sixteen, roughly in 2011 or 2012. Some were about Call of Duty, others about Minecraft, and then the list kept expanding.\n\nI liked podcasts because they made it possible to spend time with a subject instead of consuming a short update. They felt like a medium with room for curiosity, personality, and long conversations.\n\nThe early marker is approximate, but the relationship is clear: podcasts were already part of my daily life long before they became as mainstream as they are now.",
